              "id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300048722",
              "type": "Type"
            }
          ],
          "content": "Thirty years after his first version of this subject, Rembrandt etched it anew and conceived it in an entirely different way. The apostles, in the left foreground, now play a mere supporting role. The focus is reserved for the Temple of Jerusalem in the background, with Solomonic columns before it and countless figures gathered around the sacrificial site."
        },
        {
          "type": "LinguisticObject",
          "classified_as": [
            {
              "id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300312075",
              "type": "Type"
            }
          ],
